*value = "Perform consecutive AIR JUGGLES on the enemies to earn bonus pick-ups. <pause>Perform an UPPERCUT ATTACK on an enemy to initiate an AIR JUGGLE. <pause>It can be instantly followed by an in-air FLARE KICK!"
*key = 3
*value = "At the hidden hour. A doppleganger waits. To use your every power. To beat you in a race."
*key = 4
*value = "This is a SUNDIAL. Jump on top. It will allow you to change the time of day!"
*key = 5
*value = "You just collected one of the 6 SOUL JARS. Collect all of them to reveal a WRAITHHEART."
*key = 6
*value = "Reia's\nDiary"
*key = 7
*value = "Heart\nTotals"
*key = 8
*value = "Heart"
*key = 9
*value = "PUGGLES are nasty little things, but not very dangerous during the DAY.  Try JUGGLING them in the air to get extra PICKUPS, and watch out for them at NIGHT!"
*key = 10
*value = "GRIMKIN are viscious, thick skulled halfwits.  They're quick on their feet though, and can DODGE your attacks"
*key = 11
*value = "SKINX are flying nuisances that will wait until the worst possible moment to dart in for a quick STAB.  Take them out with an UPPERCUT or FLARE KICK first."
*key = 12
*value = "ABSCONX will try to HELP you, or drop you to your DOOM, but you might not know until too late.  Shake the ANALOG STICK left and right to BREAK FREE when CAUGHT."
*key = 13
*value = "SHADOWCREEPS are cowards at heart, HIDING until your BACK is turned, then darting in for a quick ATTACK.  LURE them into ATTACKING and turn the tables on them."
*key = 14
*value = "The SHADOWGUARD are YABU'S elite.  TOUGH and well trained, they'll BLOCK your hits unless you catch them OFF GUARD."
*key = 15
*value = "SHADOWMINIONS are YABU'S pawns.  Hard to get past their SHIELD, you'll find them EASIER if you can get them into the AIR."
*key = 16
*value = "WRAITHOUNDS are born to chase down PREY.  Their HIT and RUN tactics will WEAR you down if you don't deal with them first."
*key = 17
*value = "BOULDERDASHERS have "
*key = 18
*value = "Dolby, Pro Logic, and the Double-D symbol\nare trademarks of Dolby Laboratories.\nManufactured under license from Dolby Laboratories."
*key = 19
*value = "Hearts:%i"
*key = 20
*value = "You just got the ROCK SUIT power up! Once you find the way to activate it, you will be invincible and as hot as lava!"
*key = 21
*value = "You just got the AIR SUIT power up! Now you must find the place to spread your wings!"
*key = 22
*value = "You just got the WATER SUIT power up! Activate your suit and you will swim like a fish!"
