*key = 133
*value = "Something terrible is coming.\nAfter all this time, Dark Yabu is\nmoving about Astara, searching.\nHe seems to have collected an army\nof beasts from the Shadowrealm.\nI fear he is trying to collect\nthe Wraithhearts to re-open the gate\nand bring back his fellow Wraiths."
